{"id":183,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Even after Marill swims in a cold sea, its water- repellent fur dries almost as soon as Marill leaves the water. That’s why this Pokémon is never cold."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"This Pokémon uses its round tail as a float. The ball of Marill’s tail is filled with nutrients that have been turned into an oil."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"When fishing for food at the edge of a fast-running stream, Marill wraps its tail around the trunk of a tree. This Pokémon’s tail is flexible and configured to stretch."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Marill’s oil-filled tail acts much like a life preserver. If you see just its tail bobbing on the water’s surface, it’s a sure indication that this Pokémon is diving beneath the water to feed on aquatic plants."},{"games":["Y","Pearl"],"text":"The tip of its tail is filled with oil that is lighter than water, so it acts as a float."},{"games":["X","Crystal"],"text":"The fur on its body naturally repels water. It can stay dry, even when it plays in the water."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2"],"text":"The oil-filled tail functions as a buoy, so it’s fine even in rivers with strong currents."},{"games":["White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"The oil-filled end of its tail floats on water. It keeps Marill from drowning even in a strong current."},{"games":["SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"The end of its tail serves as a buoy that keeps it from drowning, even in a vicious current."},{"games":["HeartGold","LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"The tip of its tail, which contains oil that is lighter than water, lets it swim without drowning."},{"games":["Diamond"],"text":"Using its tail as a float, it dives underwater. It likes eating plants that grow on river bottoms."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"Its body is covered with water-repellent fur. Because of the fur, it can swim through water at high speed without being slowed by the water’s resistance."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Thick Fat","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon is protected by a layer of thick fat, which halves the damage taken from Fire- and Ice-type moves."},{"name":"Huge Power","hidden":false,"description":"Doubles the Pokémon's Attack stat."},{"name":"Sap Sipper","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon takes no damage when hit by Grass-type moves. Instead, its Attack stat is boosted."}],"eggGroups":["Water 1","Fairy"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":10,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"fast","habitat":"water's edge","color":"Blue","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":298,"name":"Azurill","condition":null,"children":[{"id":183,"name":"Marill","condition":"Level up, High Friendship","children":[{"id":184,"name":"Azumarill","condition":"Lv. 18","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,33],[1,39],[1,55],[1,111],[1,205],[1,270],[6,61],[9,204],[12,21],[15,340],[19,401],[21,583],[24,392],[27,240],[30,56],[33,38],[36,276]],"machine":[914,133,59,34,280,523,204,886,91,574,38,577,227,203,263,313,374,264,447,270,56,304,58,8,861,196,282,113,710,118,802,581,341,189,330,583,182,240,156,214,883,164,57,129,36,851,885,352,127,250],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me2pt5-232","name":"Marill","set":"Ascended Heroes","date":"2026-01-30","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"232","artist":"Rond","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-232/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-232/large"},{"id":"me55-67","name":"Marill","set":"30th Celebration","date":"2026-09-16","rarity":"Common","number":"67","artist":"Saya Tsuruta","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-67/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-67/large"},{"id":"me2pt5-83","name":"Marill","set":"Ascended Heroes","date":"2026-01-30","rarity":"Common","number":"83","artist":"Yoshimoto Yoshimon","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-83/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-83/large"},{"id":"me2pt5-84","name":"Azumarill 